WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
(wind howling) Frozen mountains stretch to the horizon.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Sintel walks alone, exhausted from the journey.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
She is searching for Scales, her dragon.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The search has lasted longer than she realizes.
